## Testing strategy

- Critical user journeys:
  - Register/login (email or Ally) → search bottle → add with overrides → hit freemium gate → subscribe
- Required test levels: unit/feature early; e2e when flows exist
- Merge-blocking checks: Adonis tests + Angular build when frontend changes
- Tests intentionally omitted and justification:
  - Full e2e and IAP flows deferred until Capacitor + billing sprint

